<div class="col-sm-12">
<div id="cs_control_4199669" class="cs_control CS_Element_Custom">
<div class="Component text-content-size text-content-style">
<p><p>The National Park Service's History Program was started in 1931 and is managed by the <a href="javascript:HandleLink('cpe_0_0','CPNEWWIN:_blank^@CP___PAGEID=7214594,/orgs/1220/npschiefhistorians.htm');" id="CPNEWWIN:_blank^@CP___PAGEID=7214594,/orgs/1220/npschiefhistorians.htm|" onmouseout=" return window.status=''; " onmouseover=" return window.status='CP___PAGEID=7214594,/orgs/1220/npschiefhistorians.htm'; ">Chief Historian</a> of the National Park Service. It administers multiple program areas, conducts historical research, and supports National Park Service staff in all matters relating to the Service's history and mission. </p></p>
</div>
</div><div id="cs_control_4199665" class="cs_control CS_Element_Schedule"><div  title="" id="CS_Element_OrgFeatureContainer"><div id="gridRow_1_1_4199665" class="cs_GridRow"><div id="gridCol_1_1_1_1_4199665" class="cs_GridColumn"><div id="cs_control_899733" class="cs_control CS_Element_Custom">
<div class="Component FeatureGrid">
<div class="row">
<div class="FeatureGrid-item col-sm-4">
<div class="Component Feature -small">
<a href="&#x2f;orgs&#x2f;1220&#x2f;administrative-history-program.htm"
class="Feature-link"
onclick="gas('send', 'event', 'Feature Grid - Prioritized', document.location.href, '&#x2f;orgs&#x2f;1220&#x2f;administrative-history-program.htm', 1, true)">
<div class="Feature-imageContainer">
<img class="Feature-image"
src="&#x2f;common&#x2f;uploads&#x2f;grid_builder&#x2f;1220&#x2f;crop16_9&#x2f;81E1C62A-A947-5E66-F6E0BC12495E62D6.jpg&#x3f;width&#x3d;640&amp;quality&#x3d;90&amp;mode&#x3d;crop"
sizes="&#x28;min-width&#x3a;&#x20;1380px&#x29;&#x20;420px,&#x20;&#x28;min-width&#x3a;&#x20;1200px&#x29;&#x20;360px,&#x20;&#x28;min-width&#x3a;&#x20;576px&#x29;&#x20;33vw,&#x20;100vw"
srcset="&#x2f;common&#x2f;uploads&#x2f;grid_builder&#x2f;1220&#x2f;crop16_9&#x2f;81E1C62A-A947-5E66-F6E0BC12495E62D6.jpg&#x3f;width&#x3d;420&amp;quality&#x3d;90&amp;mode&#x3d;crop&#x20;420w,&#x20;&#x2f;common&#x2f;uploads&#x2f;grid_builder&#x2f;1220&#x2f;crop16_9&#x2f;81E1C62A-A947-5E66-F6E0BC12495E62D6.jpg&#x3f;width&#x3d;640&amp;quality&#x3d;90&amp;mode&#x3d;crop&#x20;640w"
alt="1937&#x20;CCC&#x20;camp&#x20;at&#x20;base&#x20;of&#x20;mesa&#x20;in&#x20;Big&#x20;Bend&#x20;National&#x20;Park,&#x20;Texas.&#x20;Photo&#x20;from&#x20;Portal&#x20;to&#x20;Texas&#x20;History">
<div class="Feature-title carrot-end">Administrative History Program</div>
</div>
</a>
<p class="Feature-description">Provides guidance to NPS parks, programs, and regions writing new administrative and legislative histories or updating existing histories.</p>
</div>
</div>
